# Documentation NOT shipped in the binary release archives.
#
# Policy is include by default: every docs/*.md goes into the archive's docs/
# directory unless its basename is listed here. Adding a new user-facing doc
# therefore needs no packaging change; only a deliberate exclusion does.
#
# List basenames only, one per line. Both the English and Chinese files must be
# listed. Give a reason for each.

# Shipped at the archive root instead, so it is the first thing seen.
RELEASE-LAYOUT.md
RELEASE-LAYOUT-CN.md

# Building or embedding Lunet from source. Irrelevant to a binary consumer, and
# actively misleading in an archive that contains no source.
XMAKE_INTEGRATION.md
XMAKE_INTEGRATION-CN.md
EMBEDDING.md
EMBEDDING-CN.md

# Contributor workflow, not user documentation.
WORKFLOW.md
WORKFLOW-CN.md

# Repository metadata: how downstream projects display Lunet badges.
BADGES.md
BADGES-CN.md

# Internal engineering report on a past integration. Historical, not reference.
EASY_MEMORY_REPORT.md
EASY_MEMORY_REPORT-CN.md
